### GitHub Actions conventions

#### Secrets naming

```
# GitHub Actions Secrets
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
AWS_REGION
<% if (integrations.aws && modules.backend) { -%>
EC2_INSTANCE_ID_STAGING
EC2_INSTANCE_ID_PROD
<% } -%>
<% if (modules.mobile && mobileFramework === 'expo-rn-nativewind') { -%>
EAS_TOKEN
<% } -%>
```

#### Workflow file structure

```
.github/workflows/
<% if (modules.backend) { -%>
  backend-staging.yml    -> push to staging -> deploy backend to staging
  backend-prod.yml       -> push to prod -> deploy backend to prod (with approval)
<% } -%>
<% if (modules.mobile) { -%>
  mobile-ci.yml          -> PR -> lint + test<% if (mobileFramework === 'expo-rn-nativewind') { %> + EAS preview build<% } %>
  mobile-release.yml     -> push to staging/prod -> <% if (mobileFramework === 'expo-rn-nativewind') { %>EAS staging/prod build<% } else { %>release build<% } %>
<% } -%>
<% if (modules.web) { -%>
  web-deploy.yml         -> push to staging/prod -> deploy web
<% } -%>
```

#### Mandatory gates before any deploy

- Lint passes
<% if (backendFramework === 'fastapi-sqlalchemy' || backendFramework === 'django') { -%>
- Typecheck passes (mypy for Python, tsc for TypeScript)
- Full test suite passes (pytest / Jest)
<% } else { -%>
- Typecheck passes (tsc)
- Full test suite passes (Jest)
<% } -%>
- Production deploys require `environment: production` with required reviewer

<% if (integrations.aws && modules.backend) { %>
#### SSM Run Command pattern (backend deploy)

```yaml
- name: Deploy to EC2 via SSM
  run: |
    aws ssm send-command \
      --instance-ids ${{ secrets.EC2_INSTANCE_ID_STAGING }} \
      --document-name "AWS-RunShellScript" \
      --parameters commands='[
        "cd /app/<%= projectName %>-Back",
        "git pull origin staging",
<% if (backendFramework === 'fastapi-sqlalchemy' || backendFramework === 'django') { -%>
        "pip install -r requirements.txt",
<% if (backendFramework === 'fastapi-sqlalchemy') { -%>
        "alembic upgrade head",
<% } else { -%>
        "python manage.py migrate",
<% } -%>
<% } else { -%>
        "npm install",
        "npm run build",
        "npx prisma migrate deploy",
<% } -%>
        "systemctl restart <%= projectName %>-back"
      ]'
```
<% } %>

<% if (integrations.aws && modules.web) { %>
#### CloudFront invalidation (web deploy)

```yaml
- name: Invalidate CloudFront
  run: |
    aws cloudfront create-invalidation \
      --distribution-id $CF_DISTRIBUTION_ID \
      --paths "/*"
```
<% } %>

